    "summary": "Spend 1 CP as the opposing player's Movement phase begins, targeting one of your GREY KNIGHTS INFANTRY units. For the rest of the phase, whenever an enemy unit gets set up, or finishes a Normal move, an Advance move or a Fall Back move, and ends up within 6\" of the chosen unit, roll a D6, adding 2 when the chosen unit is wholly inside your **[Hallowed Ground](vsdata:ability/grey-knights.warpbane-task-force.hallowed-ground)**. A total of 4+ deals D3 mortal wounds to that enemy unit.",
